      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>OUTPUT block with no inputs.</li>
      <li>Nonzero state outputs onValue; zero state outputs offValue.</li>
      <li>onLabel and offLabel affect UI labels only.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y = \begin{cases} onValue, &amp; state \ne 0 \\ offValue, &amp; state = 0 \end{cases}</latex>
